cmu-dutchs-dozen-greeting = [color=#ffbf00][bold]You are a member of Dutch's Dozen![/bold] You know everything there is to know about the Yautja, down to every minute detail. The Yautja mask on your leader's face lets the Yautja track you, or you lay traps for them: they can detect their gear signatures and will home in on that mask as soon as you arrive. Dutch's Concoction, the EMP grenades you carry, cover a very wide area. They break a Yautja's cloak and drain their bracer charge.[/color] [bold]Objectives: hunt down and kill all Yautja without mercy. Retrieve the gear and leave. Your objective is the Yautja planetside, NOT the xenomorphs.[/bold]
cmu-dutchs-dozen-greeting-arnold = [color=#ffbf00][bold]You are Dutch, the leader of Dutch's Dozen![/bold] You know everything there is to know about the Yautja, down to every minute detail. The Yautja mask on your face lets the Yautja track you, or you lay traps for them: they can detect their gear signatures and will home in on that mask as soon as you arrive. Dutch's Concoction, the EMP grenades in your pouch, cover a very wide area. They break a Yautja's cloak and drain their bracer charge.[/color] [bold]Objectives: hunt down and kill all Yautja without mercy. Retrieve the gear and leave. Your objective is the Yautja planetside, NOT the xenomorphs.[/bold]
